{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act7d5_level_act7d5_st03",
  "groupId": "act7d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "今日厨房",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act7d5/level_act7d5_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b5f6e3f116d0e8548f63613cd46c26f99ba98c1f5d423632aaa60961717d5a6c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "9:50 A.M.  天气/晴\n罗德岛舰船，第二舱室，公共食堂"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "北谢拉格风爆炒绿英菜，再撒上少许罗德岛特制调味粉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这样就完成了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "哇！看起来好好吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "过奖了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这种绿叶蔬菜在谢拉格很少见，我也很少有机会尝试去料理，能顺利再好不过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "雪境不比罗德岛，在谢拉格的雪原上，许多东西都很匮乏，是花钱也很难买到的。这里虽说是在舰上，但物资却还是很充足，真是难得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "物资啊......这方面的事情，我好像听可露希尔姐姐提起过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好像是说，罗德岛有专门的采购渠道，定期会有采购人员向舰内运送物资什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "因为在很多地方都有据点，所以就经常能尝到各地各种不同的食材啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "怪不得。不过，在很多地方都有据点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嗯......好像是类似什么、办事处一类的地方。这个我不懂啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "对了，食堂外面的告示板上不是还贴了心愿单吗？如果有什么特别想吃的东西，都可以写在那上面哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "据说负责采购的哥哥姐姐们会参考那个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员A",
      "text": "小古米的嘴真甜，再叫一声姐姐，姐姐给你带糖回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "采购姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员A",
      "text": "哎，乖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员B",
      "text": "你正经点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员B",
      "text": "角峰先生是吧，有什么想要的食材可以尝试写在告示板上，如果有机会的话，我们会进行采购。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "明白了，有需要的话我会尝试，届时就辛苦各位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员B",
      "text": "不必这样客气，这是我们的职责。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员A",
      "text": "你们说话怎么那么死板？大家都是一条船上的人了，放轻松点、自由点说话行不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员B",
      "text": "你那是自由过头了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的采购员B",
      "text": "两位别理这家伙，我们接下来还有任务，就不打扰两位了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嘿嘿，大家都是很好的人呢，之前停靠在城市边的时候，可露希尔姐姐还带我一起去采购了哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "虽然她会买些怪怪的东西......不过还是很有意思的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "哈哈，这我也有所耳闻。之前是不是还因为买了巨大陶土面具，惹那位凯尔希医生生气了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊哈哈哈，没错没错，我试过一次，那个面具太怪了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那种一看就很奇怪的东西，就不要去尝试了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "嗯，菜凉下来了，温度正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "唔，好像有一点咸了，这个口味，可能会有一点刺激......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "不会啦，我觉得一定很好吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊，要不然让我试吃看看吧？可以吗，让我吃吃看吧，角峰大叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "大、大叔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（在这个年纪的孩子眼里，我已经是大叔了吗......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "当然没问题，如果你愿意尝尝看的话，算是帮了我大忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好耶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿，让我尝一尝......咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "欸......怎么回事，这盘菜，怎么感觉好像、好像比之前要少了一点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好奇怪啊，是我的错觉吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "算啦，让我来尝尝看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "啊——唔。啊呜啊呜啊呜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "（咀嚼咀嚼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "怎、怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "唔姆唔姆。咕噜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好吃！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "蔬菜又脆又多汁而且非常爽口，调味也很清爽，完全不会让人感觉味道很重！哇啊总之就是好好吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是、是吗，多谢夸奖，这样我就放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不过没有你说的这么夸张，这种料理方法步骤简单，很适合家庭制作，之后我会把菜谱留一份挂在小厨房，大家都可以试试看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "好耶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "角峰大叔也可以看古米的营养满分乌萨斯秘制蔬菜冻汤！我们交换~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "听起来很美味，那么下次给小姐们做宵夜的时候，就让我来试试看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "嘿嘿。初雪小姐和崖心小姐一定会喜欢的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（大小姐和二小姐吗......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "对了，古米小小姐，你做好的蛋炖肉排，不快点送过去可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是给博士做的吧？再放下去就快要凉透了，会很影响口感......不要紧吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "哇！差点忘记了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "text": "那我先走啦！角峰大叔！炒绿英菜超好吃的，一定要记得留菜谱呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "真是个有活力的小姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "出来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......不出来吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那么，别怪我不客气——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "可怕可怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "也没必要上来就动刀动枪吧？说来，你那武器是从哪掏出来的？怎么来厨房还带着武器，真危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "唉，你是怎么发现我的？奇怪了，我觉得自己藏得挺好的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "（咬苹果）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "又来厨房偷吃东西吗，其实你完全不必这样，如果饿了，直接去食堂就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "上次的教训还不够？我记得之前后勤处的人员应该有和你强调过，如果再被发现利用特殊能力擅自取用料理或食材，会有相对的处罚吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "处罚？哦，你是说他们定的那个，‘被抓一次就在脸上画一只乌龟’的那个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "这算什么处罚，我还以为是在开玩笑来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "哎，不对，你还没说是怎么发现我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "如果不是你动了我刚做的菜，总量少了一点，我也不会察觉到你的存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "啊呀，失算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "我本来只是想来找找有没有什么早饭剩下的东西可以吃，但是你做的那个，闻起来太香了，一时没忍住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "对不住，真是对不住，我道歉，本人伊桑真诚道歉。啊，还是说道歉也没用？你很在意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "太好了，你原谅......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "等下，嗯？你说啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "我说，是的，我很在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "喂喂喂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "（不是吧，这家伙居然承认了？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "（不得了，这胆量不得了，居然敢承认这么危险的事情！这可是可能会要吃传票的大问题啊！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "啊，啊？什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "——刚刚没用餐具，直接用手抓菜了吧！而且也没洗手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "太不卫生了！这样怎么能行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "你刚刚说在意的......就这事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "注意卫生不是一件小事！对待食物要更加有诚心，特别是别人亲手制作的食物，每一份都是蕴含制作者的心意的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "等等，你的苹果不会也没洗吧？身为战士，对自己的身体健康要更加负责任才行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "好、好，知道了知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这种敷衍的态度......就是因为这样，杜宾小姐才会总是朝你发火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......算了，这的确不是我该多管的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "别这样，我真的在反省啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "只是那什么，哎，有时候习惯这东西真不是那么好改的，从前我也没这么讲究过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "不过你说错一点，这回我有记得洗手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "只用水冲个一秒根本不算洗手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "你也太严格了吧老兄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "不说这个，不说这个，下次我一定记得行了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "真是轻浮的家伙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "对了，刚刚你尝过那盘菜，感想如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "感想？你说那个炒蔬菜？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "那个叫古米的小姑娘不是夸过一遍了吗，还要我再说一遍？也行，好吃哦，味道超棒，真不愧是你耶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "你还有更敷衍一点的说辞吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "还真有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "别说出来，我怕我忍不住教训你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "哈哈哈，说正经的，你真想听实话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "好吧，那我直说了，你做的菜虽然好吃，但怎么说呢，吃起来感觉很迷茫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "别说傻话，我做的菜还没到能吃出感情的地步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "啧，你这人真没趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "行吧，实际上是我好几次看到你一边做菜一边叹气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "超明显的。又是发呆又是叹气，真难为你这种状态下还能把菜烧得这么好吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "停，停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "算了呗，老兄，你不想说就别勉强，我一点也不在意的，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "虽然不知道你在烦恼什么，但我劝你万事看开点，别和自己过不去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "你看我，过去还是那个样子，看开了之后其实也没什么。反正看不开我也不能怎么样，还不如不想呢，罗德岛的日子挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "哎，换个话题，我刚刚就想问了，你那边锅里煮的什么呢，闻起来真香。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......那是已经做好的烩兽肉，一会我还要撒点干酪上去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这是谢拉格的乡土菜，雪境人从小都吃这个长大，我有稍微做一些改良，让这种兽肉吃起来更细嫩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "哦！听起来很好啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "这个也让我尝尝行不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "等等，这个不行，这个是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你在这里，角峰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "老爷！您什么时候来的罗德岛，怎么也不通知属下一声？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "请稍待，我去给您泡茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "银灰",
      "text": "不必，我只是路过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "讯使",
      "text": "这次只是谢拉格那边的事情临时要找博士，所以来得很匆忙，事出突然，就没来得及告诉角峰大哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "讯使",
      "text": "行程这么赶，老爷也太勉强自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "原来如此......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "银灰",
      "text": "比起这个，角峰，恩希亚最近怎么样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "二小姐很有精神，病情已经得到了控制。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "按您吩咐的，小姐的身体状况我和讯使都有关注，以免小姐不适应罗德岛的饮食，稍后我会为二小姐单独送一份午餐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "银灰",
      "text": "那就好。顺便再热一壶咸乳茶吧，恩希亚一向喜欢那个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "讯使",
      "text": "口味一直都没变过呢，老爷和小姐都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "是，一切听从您的吩咐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "银灰",
      "text": "嗯，那就这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "银灰",
      "text": "有劳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这是老爷吩咐过，专门给二小姐准备的，一会我就要给她送过去。如果你还饿着的话，我可以再重新给你做点什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "是，是，那真是谢谢你。我也想吃那个什么很嫩的肉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那是珍贵食材，还是拜托任务会路过那边据点的干员带回来的，总共也就这么一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "而且，烩肉做起来太费时间了，你就用普通的炒兽肉将就一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "过分！区别待遇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不自己动手的人没资格抱怨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "也对！那我还是赚了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "我说，你说的老爷，就是你们的老板吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "那位偶尔会突然露面，只和博士有话说的银灰老爷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "没错。你见过老爷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不管见没见过，我劝你最好学会说话更尊敬点，这没坏处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "已经很尊敬了，这不是还带了敬称嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "说正经的，你们老板，我记得好像听其他人说他有两个妹妹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "没错。怎么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "那，那个叫恩希亚的菲林女孩，就是你说的‘二小姐’吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "挺贴心的好哥哥嘛，还特地让你来做家乡菜，是怕妹妹吃得不习惯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "不过怎么都是送给二小姐的东西，那大小姐呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......你到底想问什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "关于两位小姐，这是老爷的家务事，我劝你最好不要多过问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "你这表情怪可怕的，放心，我才懒得管有钱人的家务事，我又不傻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "啊，帮我递一下那边的调味瓶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "这个？给，接好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "不客气。哦，香味出来了香味出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "好了，虽然只是普通的炒兽肉，但我有调整过配料，味道应该不差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那边的篮子里有面包，旁边的锅里应该还有米饭，你自己爱吃什么就配什么，我先把菜给小姐送过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "吃之前，记得先洗手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "快走吧你，你是我老妈吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "不是。幸好我不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "......这就走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "唉，可惜，那个烩肉闻起来真的蛮香的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "那就洗个手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "真是怪了，我干啥这么老实听话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "好，还用了清洗液，每只手三十秒......三、二、一。这样就行了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "（甩手）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "嘿，这下没问题了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "至少把手擦干再抓面包吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "谁啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......不是什么重要的人，只是个普通铁匠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯？奇怪，角峰他不在吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "谢谢，角峰，茶给我就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯，好香，茶里还放了香油？呵呵，那都是小时候的喝法了，难为你还记得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "大小姐谬赞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那么，两位慢用。在下就先失礼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（在茶里放香油，以前最喜欢这么做的，应该是老爷才对。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（从维多利亚回来之后，老爷就再没有这样喝过咸乳茶了，或许是忘记了吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（大小姐......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（二小姐这次又把水椒全挑出来了，哎，这个习惯倒是从小到大都没变过。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（老爷也不管一管，再这么挑食下去，营养会不均衡，问题很严重啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "这么说来，我记得老爷从前，的确也会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（不行，打住。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "（这个问题太危险了，还是不要深究，就当做没有过吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂喂喂前面的老兄——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "嗯？什么人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "我啦！是我！一般看到东西自己在路上飘着那就也只有我了吧！你是不是装傻啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "算了。诺，这个给你，拿好别摔了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "什么，这个是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊桑",
      "text": "就这样，我还有事，先走一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "那家伙搞什么，这个是......三明治？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "面包烤的时间太长，也没有切边，里面的鳞蜥肉切得太厚，这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "也别说得这么严厉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "我看他做得还挺认真的，还切了甘仔片夹进去，味道应该还可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......火神小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "抱歉，您是来取盾牌的吧，我把几块要修理的全都放在厨房了，这就去取过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "没关系，我和你一起去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "对了，刚才跑过去的那家伙，在做三明治的时候说了奇怪的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "伊桑他说了什么让您不愉快的话吗？如果是这样，我先代他向您道歉。他这个人说话比较随意，但是没有什么恶意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "那倒不是。你急急忙忙解释什么，我只是有点奇怪而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "他说‘要让角峰大叔尝尝当代没心没肺青年人的瞎做料理当作回礼，姑且也算是蕴含心意吧’。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "哦对，他还把放在厨房的那两盘做好的菜全端走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "什么乱七八糟的，简直是胡闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "的确是胡闹，不过，我怎么觉得你好像心情变好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "没有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "text": "你照照镜子再这么说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "......不过话说回来，伊桑他多大年纪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "text": "为什么连那家伙都在喊我大叔啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
